config BR2_PACKAGE_APOTHECA_TOOLS
	bool "apotheca-tools"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_SDL2
	help
	  Two small programs for bring-up and the desk test:
	  padprobe (what SDL sees of the joysticks, in controls.txt's
	  numbers) and fakepad (a uinput stand-in for the RG40XXV's
	  joypad, for qemu). In /usr/libexec/apotheca.
